
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>BUILDORA | Payroll &amp; Finance</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-[#e9e7e2] text-[#26343e]">
  <header class="bg-[#26343e] text-white">
    <nav class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-5 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <span class="w-3 h-8 bg-[#efb600] -skew-x-12"></span>
        <span class="text-2xl font-extrabold">BUILDORA</span>
      </div>
      <a class="bg-[#efb600] text-[#26343e] font-bold text-sm px-5 py-2" href="/login">Login</a>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-[#a67a00] text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">XianFire Module 5</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold mt-5">Payroll &amp; Finance Management</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mt-5 max-w-2xl">Manage payroll records, pay rates, finance reviews, project budgets and verified workforce attendance.</p>
    <a class="inline-block bg-[#efb600] text-[#26343e] font-bold px-7 py-3 mt-8" href="/login">Open Workspace</a>
    <section class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mt-16">
      <article class="bg-[#f8f7f5] border border-[#d7d5cf] p-6"><h2 class="font-bold">Payroll / Finance Officer</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3">Create payroll periods, set rates, record earnings, deductions and payments.</p></article>
      <article class="bg-[#f8f7f5] border border-[#d7d5cf] p-6"><h2 class="font-bold">Finance Manager</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3">Review payroll, approve authorized budgets and monitor expenses.</p></article>
      <article class="bg-[#f8f7f5] border border-[#d7d5cf] p-6"><h2 class="font-bold">HR Manager</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-3">View worker information and verified attendance for payroll validation.</p></article>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer class="bg-[#26343e] text-slate-300 text-xs text-center p-6">BUILDORA — Powered by XianFire Framework</footer>
</body>
</html>